  "ingredients": [
    "1 (16 ounce) package dried penne pasta",
    "5 tablespoons olive oil, divided",
    "2 skinless, boneless chicken breast halves - cut into cubes",
    "0.25 teaspoon garlic powder, or more to taste",
    "salt and ground black pepper to taste",
    "0.5 cup low-sodium chicken broth",
    "1 bunch slender asparagus spears, trimmed, cut on diagonal into 1-inch pieces",
    "1 clove garlic, thinly sliced",
    "0.25 cup grated Parmesan cheese"
  ],
  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "Gather the ingredients.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/Vz7i7jQ-WPn5dF8uMd9mNJifxdQ=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/90089-penne-with-chicken-and-asparagus-DDMFS-042-4x3-step-01-ab6cb3184c2a4caf9be8d104d6cceb67.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/90089/step_01.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Bring a large pot of lightly salted water to a boil. Add penne and cook, stirring occasionally, until tender yet firm to the bite, about 11 minutes. Drain.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/mVsuGjolvT51cSG62cB7Q05hfTA=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/90089-penne-with-chicken-and-asparagus-DDMFS-048-4x3-step-02-4acb3e5cacc84df8a252365915bf58dc.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/90089/step_02.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "While the pasta is cooking, heat 3 tablespoons oil in a large skillet over medium-high heat. Stir in chicken and season with 1/4 teaspoon garlic powder, salt, and pepper. Cook and stir until chicken is browned and the juices run clear, about 5 minutes.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/Xm0WQKME_U8b5L0MOmoV0TWhhi0=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/90089-penne-with-chicken-and-asparagus-DDMFS-060-4x3-step-05-5e0f460027dc4428ad74ed32ed052dbe.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/90089/step_03.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Transfer chicken to a paper towel-lined plate.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/yQdgGJ0kUeT2NOGEn3R2FDCOQjw=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/90089-penne-with-chicken-and-asparagus-DDMFS-061-4x3-step-06-8f49aa944d5249f2a63ee86f2ca3a199.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/90089/step_04.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Pour chicken broth into the skillet. Add asparagus, garlic, and another pinch of garlic powder. Season with salt and pepper. Cover and steam until asparagus is just tender, 5 to 10 minutes.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/JrTi9G3wqOsXPWsDIO56Bi-xX6k=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/90089-penne-with-chicken-and-asparagus-DDMFS-069-4x3-step-08-ca62b83a21a045108d6c94e4217291fe.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/90089/step_05.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Return chicken to the skillet and cook until heated through, 2 to 3 minutes.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/lOVpyZFpEjhAdtwxWxaeBLpmCRU=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/90089-penne-with-chicken-and-asparagus-DDMFS-071-4x3-step-09-208c8088bbdb4f9a99695dccbc959148.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/90089/step_06.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Transfer drained penne to a large bowl. Pour chicken mixture over top and mix until well combined. Let sit for about 5 minutes.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/cRh1LK0iQjKj_dXsF1grau75jIE=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/90089-penne-with-chicken-and-asparagus-DDMFS-072-4x3-step-10-32c3504f7c1b4e429afd4989339c25ac.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/90089/step_07.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Stir in remaining 2 tablespoons olive oil, then sprinkle with Parmesan cheese.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/nmIPEvSOQBA3DwRxR-L4dMz7GRM=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/90089-penne-with-chicken-and-asparagus-DDMFS-073-4x3-step-11-f6ebec1fa73d43569fb6009bc08d8488.jpg"
      ],
